      "title": "Travian: Legends – International | The Online Multiplayer Strategy Game",
      "text": "English\nLogin\nROMANS\nDisciplined legions, advanced engineering, and strategic brilliance define Rome. Lead your legionaries to expand your empire through military might and cultural dominance.\nTEUTONS\nFierce raiders, ruthless warriors, and unrelenting aggression characterize the Teutons. Lead your savage forces to pillage enemies and strike fear into their hearts with lightning-fast attacks.\nGAULS\nSwift defenders, cunning traps, and hidden crannies protect Gaul resources. Lead your tribe to outlast foes with resilience and guile.\nWinter Time – The Effects on Your Game\nWinter time is coming! Find out how the time change affects server time, troop movements, daily quests, and other in-game events.\n22/10/2026 | 16:19\nShow all news\nPLAY NOW\nNext upcoming game world\n03/11\nINTERNATIONAL 21\n×2\nShow game world calendar\nTerms & Conditions\nRight of Withdrawal\nPrivacy Policy\nGame Rules\nSupport\nImprint\n© 2004 - 2026 Travian Games GmbH. All rights reserved.",
